{"id":"wb-7-634","name":"南禅湾晋墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南禅湾晋墓群","text":"南禅湾晋墓群位于湖南省常德市安乡县黄山头镇黄山头国家森林公园内，墓群最早发现于20世纪80年代。1996年，湖南省将其公布为省级文物保护单位。2013被公布为全国重点文物保护单位，保护范围以刘弘墓中心点为基点，至东166米，西90米，南70米，北50米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E7%A6%85%E6%B9%BE%E6%99%8B%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":94303174,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94303174","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b624b1f084f643ff7d277476.jpg","title":"宣成公章.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%A3%E6%88%90%E5%85%AC%E7%AB%A0.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/%E5%AE%A3%E6%88%90%E5%85%AC%E7%AB%A0.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ddayzzz","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宣成公章，1991年出土于湖南省安乡县南禅湾晋墓群——刘弘墓。现藏于湖南博物院","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应百科配图的名称与所在地一致"}}